# Salary Survey Data Cleaning 🧹📊

A data cleaning project using **Python and Pandas** to clean, standardize, and prepare a Salary Survey dataset for further analysis.

> This project was completed as part of my training at **NTI (National Telecommunication Institute)**.

---

## 📌 About the Project

This project focuses on cleaning and preparing a Salary Survey dataset that contains information about salaries, jobs, industries, countries, education, experience, and other employee-related attributes.

The dataset contained several real-world data quality issues, including:

* Missing values
* Inconsistent country names
* Inconsistent city and state values
* Incorrect or unusual values
* Duplicate/inconsistent entries
* Different formats for the same information
* Unclean job titles and industries

The goal was to make the dataset more consistent and ready for analysis.

