## 📊 Normalization

After cleaning the Salary column, I applied several normalization techniques to understand different ways of scaling numerical data.

### Min-Max Normalization

Scales values between 0 and 1.

```text
(x - min) / (max - min)
```

### Z-Score Normalization

Standardizes values based on the mean and standard deviation.

```text
(x - mean) / standard deviation
```

### Robust Normalization

Uses the median and Interquartile Range (IQR), making it less sensitive to extreme values.

```text
(x - median) / IQR
```

### Decimal Scaling

Scales values by a power of 10 based on the maximum absolute value.

